+# Changelog
+
+## 2026-10-30 - Click limits for short links
+
+Links can now carry an optional click limit (maxClicks, 1..1,000,000). After the limit is reached redirects return 410 Gone; link metadata exposes maxClicks and remainingClicks. Schema: V2 adds nullable links.max_clicks. Existing links are unaffected.
